.TH HEXCHAT-NG "1" "November 2026" "hexchat-ng @VERSION@" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
hexchat-ng \- IRC client with a Qt 6 interface
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hexchat-ng
[OPTION...] [URL...]
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show command line options.
.TP
.B \-a, \-\-no-auto
Do not connect to saved networks automatically.
.TP
.B \-d, \-\-cfgdir=PATH
Use a separate configuration directory.
.TP
.B \-n, \-\-no-plugins
Do not load plugins automatically.
.TP
.B \-u, \-\-configdir
Print the configuration directory.
.TP
.B \-v, \-\-version
Print the application version.
.TP
.B \-\-minimize=LEVEL
Start normally (0), minimized (1), or in the tray (2).
.SH AUTHOR
Copyright 2026 Britney Lozza and the ZoiteChat, HexChat and X-Chat contributors.
